(7440754, 1176427, 59737, '<td valign="top">Plasma ball, I used to have one of those.  Good subject for the challenge.  Well positioned in the frame and I like the yellow glow around the ball.</td>', 'Plasma ball, I used to have one of those.  Good subject for the challenge.  Well positioned in the frame and I like the yellow glow around the ball.', '2016-03-03 20:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
