(7440998, 1176921, 59737, '<td valign="top">very painterly,  more impressionist than abstract to me but I like the colors and light of the image.  Makes me think of Italy especially with the red white and green colors.</td>', 'very painterly,  more impressionist than abstract to me but I like the colors and light of the image.  Makes me think of Italy especially with the red white and green colors.', '2016-03-04 16:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
