(7441979, 1176835, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is actually a fascinating image and I quite like its ambiguity of scale and its determinedly esoteric composition. I''m sure the voters are hammering you, but *I* think it''s terrific. Those *look* like they could be eyelashes lower right :-)</td>', 'This is actually a fascinating image and I quite like its ambiguity of scale and its determinedly esoteric composition. I''m sure the voters are hammering you, but *I* think it''s terrific. Those *look* like they could be eyelashes lower right :-)', '2016-03-08 15:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
