(7442176, 1176515, 50695, '<td valign="top">i don''t know how you did it, but I like this complex wash of faces. abstractions feel more like experiences than images. they seem to take place over time instead of freezing a moment.</td>', 'i don''t know how you did it, but I like this complex wash of faces. abstractions feel more like experiences than images. they seem to take place over time instead of freezing a moment.', '2016-03-08 23:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
