(7442269, 1176835, 182158, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> is this a pet''s ear? by going in close and glancing along the edges of a thing, you can make it nothing at all, and this nothing is abstraction, and can have its own beauty. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>These are my daughter''s eyelashes and the color is a blanket beside her. I shall upload the original tomorrow :)</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: is this a pet''s ear? by going in close and glancing along the edges of a thing, you can make it nothing at all, and this nothing is abstraction, and can have its own beauty.   These are my daughter''s eyelashes and the color is a blanket beside her. I shall upload the original tomorrow :)', '2016-03-09 01:00:33.000000', NULL, 0),
