(7442278, 1176835, 182158, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Bear_Music:</b></div><hr/><i> This is actually a fascinating image and I quite like its ambiguity of scale and its determinedly esoteric composition. I''m sure the voters are hammering you, but *I* think it''s terrific. Those *look* like they could be eyelashes lower right :-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you! It seems you catch me :)</td>', 'Originally posted by Bear_Music: This is actually a fascinating image and I quite like its ambiguity of scale and its determinedly esoteric composition. I''m sure the voters are hammering you, but *I* think it''s terrific. Those *look* like they could be eyelashes lower right :-)   Thank you! It seems you catch me :)', '2016-03-09 01:05:30.000000', NULL, 0),
