(7442315, 1176936, 156466, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> an extremely obvious abstract pattern distorted by a transparency of some sort, stuck right in the center of the image. this sort of stability makes an image forgettable... though I do like the colors of the art you are taking a picture of. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks, Don.  This may be the most meaningful comment I''ve received in my time here.  At a minimum it''s the type of comment I was hoping for when I posted my first image.  And just when I''d given up on this place.</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: an extremely obvious abstract pattern distorted by a transparency of some sort, stuck right in the center of the image. this sort of stability makes an image forgettable... though I do like the colors of the art you are taking a picture of.   Thanks, Don.  This may be the most meaningful comment I''ve received in my time here.  At a minimum it''s the type of comment I was hoping for when I posted my first image.  And just when I''d given up on this place.', '2016-03-09 08:34:11.000000', NULL, 0),
