(7442766, 1176818, 138630, '<td valign="top">You achieved a beautiful result.  Sorry about the DQ though I understand it and I''m sure you do, too.  I can only hope <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=118154" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Tiny</a>''s comment was supposed to be in jest as I find it tasteless and not funny.</td>', 'You achieved a beautiful result.  Sorry about the DQ though I understand it and I''m sure you do, too.  I can only hope  Tiny''s comment was supposed to be in jest as I find it tasteless and not funny.', '2016-03-10 10:45:18.000000', NULL, 0),
